[en.DECISION_C08_C28_SUPPORT]
Support from Seaquestria

[en.DECISION_C08_C28_SUPPORT_desc]
Silverstream tells us that Seaquestria is willing to support Equestria, but is worried that supporting the Resistance will make them a target of the illegal empire.

Though, the situation is vastly different from three years ago. Now we have control of Manehattan, and the illegal empire can no longer hold onto the land they illegally seized. Therefore, now Silverstream can help us contact Seaquestria and get their support. Of course, as a Hippogriff from Seaquestria, Silverstream must know how her homeland developed their naval power... It’s time to bring Feather Bangs back to the Army.

[zh.DECISION_C08_C28_SUPPORT]
海马利亚的支援

[zh.DECISION_C08_C28_SUPPORT_desc]
银溪告诉我们海马利亚并非无心支援小马利亚，而是担心支持抵抗事业会受到伪帝国威胁。

现在情况较三年前已经截然不同。我们已经控制了马哈顿，而伪帝国已经连自己篡夺的土地都控制不住。因此，如今银溪可以帮我们联络海马利亚，争取海马利亚的支援。当然，作为海马利亚的骏鹰，银溪一定更了解自己的家乡是怎么发展海上力量的... 是时候让羽波回到陆军部了。
